#
# TASK TYPES BY MODULE:
# ==================
# ASSET Tasks:
#   - REVISION: User is RISK_OWNER, asset status = REVISI, owned by department
#   - PENDING_RM_APPROVAL: User is RISK_MANAGER, asset status = MENUNGGU_PERSETUJUAN_RM
#   - REJECTED_BY_TL: User is RISK_MANAGER, AssetApprovalTL status = DITOLAK
#   - PENDING_TL_APPROVAL: User is TOP_MANAGEMENT, asset status = MENUNGGU_PERSETUJUAN_FINAL
#
# RISK Tasks:
#   - REVISION: User is RISK_OWNER, risk status = REVISI, owned by department
#   - PENDING_RM_APPROVAL: User is RISK_MANAGER, risk status = MENUNGGU_PERSETUJUAN_RM
#   - REJECTED_BY_TL: User is RISK_MANAGER, RiskApprovalTL status = DITOLAK
#   - PENDING_TL_APPROVAL: User is TOP_MANAGEMENT, risk status = MENUNGGU_PERSETUJUAN_FINAL
#
# TREATMENT Tasks:
#   - PENDING_APPROVAL: User is TOP_MANAGEMENT, isApprovedByTop = false (newly created)
#   - NEEDS_TREATMENT: User is RISK_MANAGER, risk meets criteria (score >= threshold, status = DISETUJUI, no treatment yet)
#   - PENDING_APPROVAL: User is RISK_OWNER, user is assigned as PIC (picId = userId)
#
# CONTROL Tasks:
#   - (Empty - Control model has no PIC field)
#
# SOA Tasks:
#   - All SOA records where user is assigned as manager (managerId = userId)
#   - statusTarget = OVERDUE if targetDate < now AND implementationStatus ≠ DIIMPLEMENTASIKAN



